    "result_text": "I added `registered_only` to `CTFd/utils/decorators/__init__.py`, next to `authed_only`. I haven't run it or any tests.\n\n- **Anonymous browser requests:** they are redirected to `auth.register` with `next=request.full_path`, so they return to the page after signing up.\n- **Authenticated users:** they pass through to the view.\n- **JSON and event-stream requests:** these get a 403 instead of a redirect, the same as `authed_only`.\n\nI built it from the catalog's `authed_only` pattern. The only difference from that pattern is the redirect target, which is `auth.register` instead of `auth.login`. The pattern check reported one low-severity deviation for that change and no high-severity ones, so no human approval is needed."
